# ESM Embeddings and Plotting

This part computes ESM-2 mean embeddings from FASTA files and generates 2D/3D plots (t-SNE, UMAP, PCA).

## Files
- `esm_factory.py` — build and save embeddings (`.pt`)
- `esm_plot.py` — reduce dimensions and create PNG + HTML plots
- `cluster/esm_plot.slurm` — cluster job to run the full workflow

## Run (cluster)
From project root:
```bash
sbatch cluster/esm_plot.slurm
```

## Outputs
- Embeddings: `data/processed/embeddings/*.pt`
- Plots: `results/embeddings/`